Full audit — five gaps, one rewrite:
1. no rounded corners at all → rounded-xl (it's a small interactive-scale element);
2. no border → subtle zinc border for surface definition;
3. no dark mode → dark variants for background, border and both text colors;
4. zero hierarchy: label and value have the same weight and color → label becomes small uppercase muted, value becomes bold tracking-tight with tabular-nums so digits don't jitter;
5. p-3 square padding reads cramped → px-4 py-3.
